4RandomizedQR : An Efficient Randomized Algorithm for Quan-
tile Regression
In this section, we introduce a more efficient randomized algorithm RandomizedQR for solving the
Quantile Regression problem. The high level overview of our approach and the intuition behind it are
described in Section 4.1. We prove its expected running time of O(nlog2(n))in two dimensions in
Section 4.2. The extension of our approach to three and higher dimensions is presented in Section 4.3.
