whereN−jrepresents the removal of jvertices from the range. Assume that the E[F(n,2,R)] =
O(T(n,2)log (n))(i.e.E[F(n,2,N)] =c0log (n)T(n,2)). Note that one of the Nrecursive calls
consumesO(T(n,2)time as it corresponds to the optimal hyperplane.
